62
00:01:19,640 --> 00:01:20,790
ihtiyacı mı?

63
00:01:21,400 --> 00:01:22,340
Fromm'a göre olgun

64
00:01:22,340 --> 00:01:24,140
sevgide dört temel unsur

65
00:01:24,140 --> 00:01:25,110
bulunur.

66
00:01:25,280 --> 00:01:26,360
İlgi,

67
00:01:26,360 --> 00:01:27,580
